<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">14072026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>An Indian crew member is dead and eight sailors wounded after Iran's Revolutionary Guard fired cruise missiles at two <sub alias="U-A-E">UAE</sub>-flagged tankers in Omani waters.</s> <s>Tehran says the ships ignored warnings on what it called a mined route, asserting a right to police the Strait of Hormuz by force.</s> <s>More than seven Indian sailors have now died in these strikes since March... the war's cost landing on the merchant crews who man the world's oil trade, not the states fighting over it.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Aid work in northern Gaza halted this week after armed men entered a food-distribution point and assaulted two World Food Programme drivers in Jabalia.</s> <s>The <sub alias="U-N">UN</sub> coordinator Ramiz Alakbarov called it intimidation, while Hamas said it was cracking down on smuggling at the depot.</s> <s>It's one documented breakdown of order inside a wider siege, with Israeli troops still holding more than sixty percent of the strip.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Yemen's government shut down every airport nationwide after striking the runway at Sanaa to block a flight carrying Houthi officials home from Iran.</s> <s>That first move ended a truce that had held since twenty twenty-two, and the Houthis answered by firing missiles that Saudi air defences intercepted over Abha.</s> <s>Pakistan's defence pact commits it to Saudi Arabia's protection... and the group's four-year calm with Riyadh now hangs by a thread.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Egypt's parliament raced a bill through committee in just two days, handing the military-linked Future of Egypt Authority statutory control over wheat imports, land, and food supply.</s> <s>The body is run by an air force colonel, and the powers it gains were once held by civilian ministries.</s> <s>Lawmakers vote before the summer recess, quietly cementing the food economy under the security state's control.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Hungary's parliament passed a constitutional amendment ending the mandate of President Tamás Sulyok in a single sentence — sign your own dismissal in five days, or face impeachment.</s> <s>The Tisza party used the very two-thirds majority that Orbán's Fidesz built over sixteen years, now turned against its own loyalist.</s> <s>Sulyok can sign, refer the amendment to the Constitutional Court, or resign, and the choice reveals a rupture inside the ruling movement itself.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Secretary of State Marco Rubio has vowed to dismantle the International Criminal Court brick by brick, launching a whole-of-government campaign of travel bans and sanctions.</s> <s>The court issued a warrant last year for Israel's premier over Gaza, and Washington had already sanctioned its judges over that case.</s> <s>The world's most powerful state is trying to demolish the one institution built to try the powerful... precisely because it moved against an ally.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Brent crude jumped two percent to just under eighty-five dollars a barrel, a four-week high, after Washington reimposed its naval blockade on Hormuz.</s> <s>A chokepoint carrying a fifth of the world's oil is now being fought over, and the price move is how a Gulf war reaches fuel and food costs from Manila to an Indian kitchen.</s> <s>Here's the paradox — the same shock squeezing importers is quietly refilling the treasuries of sanctioned exporters like Russia.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Volkswagen warned it may cut as many as one hundred thousand jobs worldwide, doubling its earlier plans.</s> <s>Chief executive Oliver Blume says the carmaker's costs run twenty percent above rivals as its sales in China fell twenty-six percent this year.</s> <s>Four German plants, two of them electric-vehicle factories, still have no confirmed future.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Shares in South Korea's <sub alias="S-K">SK</sub> Hynix crashed fifteen percent in a single day of Seoul trading.</s> <s>The company controls fifty-eight percent of the memory chips that power artificial intelligence, making it one of the most concentrated bottlenecks in the entire tech economy.</s> <s>Earnings due this month will test whether demand for its next-generation chips justifies the price the market had placed on it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>North Korea's recent growth is real, but almost none of the cash is domestic.</s> <s>Russia's war economy pays for munitions and labour, while Chinese trade and illicit revenue fill the rest of Pyongyang's books.</s> <s>Sanctions built to isolate the country now compete with two patrons willing to keep it solvent... making it harder to pressure, not easier.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>On <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">12082026</say-as>, a total solar eclipse will darken northern Spain and parts of Central Europe — the continent's first in nearly thirty years.</s> <s>Totality happens because the Moon sits four hundred times closer than the Sun and four hundred times smaller, briefly matching its apparent size exactly.</s> <s>The path crosses Burgos at sunset, and the next total eclipse won't touch Spain's south until twenty twenty-seven.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Economists have, for the first time, put numbers on a claim long argued in history classrooms about the French Revolution.</s> <s>Matching salt-tax and customs records against revolt counts from seventeen fifty to seventeen eighty-nine, they found high-tax districts saw twice as many uprisings as low-tax ones.</s> <s>The finding turns an old assertion into a natural experiment that any state with unequal extraction can now be tested against.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Zimbabwe is pairing telehealth with case managers to reconnect deported migrants to the <sub alias="H-I-V">HIV</sub> treatment they lose when they're forced across a border.</s> <s>Every deportation risks cutting a patient off mid-course, and a lapse in the antiretroviral regimen can undo years of care.</s> <s>It's a low-cost intervention from a Global South health system, engineering around the way migration itself drives people out of treatment.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Researchers in London have built a collision dummy calibrated to human pain, asking eleven test subjects to mark exactly when contact hurt.</s> <s>Using three contact sizes across six regions of the arm, they separated superficial pain from deep-tissue pain to set precise thresholds.</s> <s>As collaborative robots increasingly share factory floors with people, standards, not intuition, will now decide how close a machine is allowed to touch us.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Your home router may already be an exit node for a foreign intelligence service.</s> <s>The U-S cyber agency says Russia's <sub alias="F-S-B">FSB</sub> exploits default router passwords, then hides attacks on energy and defence targets behind ordinary residential addresses.</s> <s>Britain and the European Union have jointly sanctioned the responsible unit, Center Sixteen, for the very first time.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Osaka, two separate teams have proven you can run the game Doom on the Neo Geo, a console many thought incapable of it.</s> <s>The machine has no frame buffer, so coders repurposed its sprite memory to fake one and render the world.</s> <s>Both ports still lack enemy logic, music, and weapon selection before either becomes truly playable.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>